{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Validity checker for a stepper trace: replays events against an independent model of the flow language (not the stepper's code) and confirms each event's preconditions held - a delivered wire's source was done and the value is the source's; an evaluated op had every awaited input delivered, every synchro source done, and was not already done; eval.in equals the delivered values; a reported rule follows from the op's condition; rule effects follow their eval; seed pre-delivers exactly the unawaited inputs; done/stall happen only when nothing is ready. Inputs: body (root Case JSON), args, events (as returned by run). Returns {status, ok, checked, violations: [{seq, type, msg}]}.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse ndata::data::Data;","params":[{"name":"body","type":"JSONObject"},{"name":"args","type":"JSONObject"},{"name":"events","type":"JSONArray"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"phmyms1a16a0b6cbfw216","readers":[],"time":1792780726457,"username":"system","writers":[]}